LTX-2 trainer changes used by SimPWM. Base: https://github.com/Lightricks/LTX-2 at e98f6d927d83c92ef2be6aec76c8440b19306e39.
Apply with `git -C deps/LTX-2 apply ../../patches/ltx_trainer.patch` (see docs/installation.md).

  process_dataset.py   --fps (frame rate recorded instead of the container's; DROID raw MP4s are muxed at 60 fps) and
                       --reshape-mode stretch (resize to the bucket without cropping)
  trainer.py           LR schedule length x num_processes; validation samples with the DDP-unwrapped model;
                       SIMPWM_BUCKET_MAP=<dataset.jsonl>: bucket-synchronised batches for length-bucketed data;
                       SIMPWM_DIST_TIMEOUT_S=<seconds>: process-group timeout
  flexible.py          SIMPWM_REF_POS_FIX=1: reference scale factors inferred under the preprocessed data root, so the
                       reference positions are rescaled in training as at inference

